'''Superhuman''' is a [[Fighting Styles|fighting style]] obtainable in the [[Second Sea]] or [[Third Sea]].

The style enhances the users overall strength, giving them a strong array of fast attacks, with good knockback and damage.

Superhuman is a long-standing fighting style in [[PVP mechanics|PvP]] due to its simple and agile moves. Because of its flexible mobility, this fighting style used to be extremely popular. 

However, it's grown quite outdated when compared to the newer and better [[fighting styles]] such as [[Dragon Talon]], [[Electric Claw]], and its upgraded version, [[Godhuman]]. This fighting style is often used to practice precision, as it's infamously known for it's slow attacks and inability to break [[Instinct]]. This fighting style is mostly used in skilled builds.

==Obtainment==
Superhuman can be learned from the [[Martial Arts Master]] by meeting the following requirements: 
* 300+ mastery on [[Dark Step]], [[Electric]], [[Water Kung Fu]], and [[Dragon Breath]] 
* {{Money|3,000,000}}

Upon obtaining Superhuman, the player will receive two [[titles]]: 

* "{{Title|The Killer}}" #142 
* "{{Title|Human Weapon}}" #143.

==Mastery==
* '''400+ Mastery:''' Superhuman is one of the requirements to obtain its "upgraded successor", [[Godhuman]].

