==Trivia==
* Superhuman is used by the [[Living Zombie]]s at [[Haunted Castle]], but they only utilize M1s (left clicks) and not the moves.
* Even though Superhuman is the most expensive V1 [[Fighting Styles|fighting style]], and others are better due to factors such as damage or range, this still is a decent fighting style to use.
* Superhuman is said to be [[Combat]]'s successor, although it was proven false after the announcement of "Superhuman V2" ([[Godhuman]]) by '''rip_indra'''.
* Superhuman is essentially a weaker version of [[Godhuman]] because both fighting styles have similar moves with Superhuman. This fighting style simply has older, more outdated design, slightly lower damage and almost no [[Instinct]] breaks, with '''[X] Thunder Clap''' not containing two variants compared to its successor, [[Godhuman]].
* Superhuman can be good for grinding [[aura]] since '''[Z] Beast Owl Pounce''' deals a decent amount of hits.
* Superhuman is the fighting style with the second highest mastery requiring obtainment, with all other [[fighting Styles|fighting styles]] (except [[Godhuman]]) being tied to each other in the mastery requirements.
* Superhuman isn't very good for grinding or PvP compared to the V2s, so it is recommended to use a different [[Fighting Styles|fighting style]], such as its upgraded version, [[Godhuman]].
* Z move can technically be a multi-target, though it works only with enemies that have current HP lower than the damage from collision. The player must also be close to the group for that to happen.

